    "body": "Safari and Chrome accomplish 2 when `p` is an actual promise and I don't think they have custom bindings for this class. Perhaps IDL should be updated to not wrap when it isn't needed?\r\n\r\nhttps://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?%3Cscript%3E%0Ap%20%3D%20Promise.resolve()%3B%0Aw((new%20PromiseRejectionEvent(%27foo%27%2C%20%7B%20promise%3A%20p%20%7D)).promise%20%3D%3D%3D%20p)%0A%3C%2Fscript%3E",
